We've been carefully watching you guys play and figured out what we need to bring into the game! Along with some new visual features that were requested we've also had a chance to polish our demo, removing some unnoying bugs. 

However, the game is still in development and if you run into some bugs, you could report them to sillylittlegamesstudio@gmail.com and we are gonna be fixing it ASAP!

[h1]Update Details[/h1]
[img]https://i.imgur.com/07Ze6B1.png[/img]
[h2]New Features [/h2]
[list]
[*] The music can be paused now;
[*] New music player;
[*] New outside view instead of a static view; 
[*] New reworked posters; 
[*] VFX Updates; 
[*] More than 10 new sounds; 
[*] New rotation mode.
[/list]
[h2]Bug Fixes[/h2]
[list]
[*] Fixed issues with painting over wall writings;
[*] Fixed issues in tutorial;
[*] Fixed rotation issues;
[*] Fixed collisions (objects are not falling through the carpet, suitcase; books are not clipping through shelves);
[*] Fixed the bug with objects falling from the casket.
[/list]

Thank you for playing! Enjoy the game!
